## API conventions (`/api/*`)
- English JSON field names; Spanish only in UI layer
- Key routes: `/auth/*`, `/clinics/*`, `/studies/*`, `/audit`, plus Master-only legacy folder tools
- Image browse restricted under `data/` (see `api/images.py`); supports `.dcm`/`.dicom`
- DICOM decode in `api/dicom_io.py`; optional `include_heatmaps=true` on screen routes
- Grad-CAM in `gradcam.py`; attached as `heatmap_data_url` per result when requested
- Models preloaded in `api/registry.py` at startup

